
### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Metwally Moahmed",
  "email": "metooqasim@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### verify OTP
# PATCH http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-account
# Content-Type: application/json

# {
#   "email": "metooqasim@gmail.com",
#   "otpCode": "858593"
# }

